      "do": "Whisk ¼ cup soy sauce, 3 Tbsp white vinegar, 2 Tbsp canola oil, 2 Tbsp chopped scallions, 2 Tbsp minced ginger, ¼ tsp sesame oil. Oven 425°; rub salmon with ½ tsp sesame oil + salt; roast 10–12 min until it flakes, brushing with 2 Tbsp dressing for the last 2 min. Microwave edamame. Bowls: greens, salmon chunks, sliced cucumber, edamame, scallions; drizzle dressing.",
